OL,3,GNEWSABanksy repair not possible in     
OL,4,AHull, council says                     
OL,6,FOfficials at Hull City Council say a   
OL,7,FBanksy mural that was removed from a   
OL,8,FHull bridge more than seven years ago  
OL,9,Fhad to be taken to Norfolk for         
OL,10,F"specialist renovation".               
OL,12,FThe work appeared on Scott Street      
OL,13,FBridge, which spanned the River Hull,  
OL,14,Fin January 2018, but was removed when  
OL,15,Fthe structure was demolished a year    
OL,16,Flater.                                 
OL,18,FThe artwork has not been seen since its
OL,19,Fremoval but the BBC revealed earlier   
OL,20,Fthis month that it is being stored in  
OL,21,FNorfolk.                               
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
