OL,3,GNEWSABanksy repair not possible in     
OL,4,AHull, council says                     
OL,6,FAt a full council meeting earlier,     
OL,7,Fdeputy leader Jackie Dad said: "Given  
OL,8,Fthe nature of this piece, the work     
OL,9,Finvolved required specialist provision 
OL,10,Fthat was not available in Hull."       
